<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Додати нову кав'ярню | Travel-Журнал</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Bootstrap Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-cream: #FAF7F2;
            --coffee-dark: #2C221E;
            --coffee-primary: #C87D55;
            --coffee-accent: #E8A87C;
            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-cream);
            color: var(--coffee-dark);
            padding-top: 80px;
        }

        .navbar {
            background-color: var(--card-bg) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(44, 34, 30, 0.05);
        }

        .form-card {
            border: 1px solid rgba(200, 125, 85, 0.15);
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(44, 34, 30, 0.05);
        }

        .btn-coffee {
            background-color: var(--coffee-primary);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-coffee:hover {
            background-color: #B26B45;
            color: white;
        }

        .form-control, .form-control:focus {
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-color: rgba(200, 125, 85, 0.3);
            background-color: #FAF7F2;
            color: var(--coffee-dark);
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(200, 125, 85, 0.15);
            border-color: var(--coffee-primary);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- НАВІГАЦІЯ -->
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg fixed-top">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold text-dark" href="/shops">
                ☕ Zruchno Coffee News
            </a>
            <a href="/shops" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm px-3 rounded-pill">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Назад до каталогу
            </a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="container my-5" style="max-width: 700px;">
        <div class="form-card p-4 p-md-5">
            <div class="text-center mb-4">
                <h2 class="fw-bold">➕ Додати нову кав'ярню</h2>
                <p class="text-muted small">Заповніть інформацію про заклад, щоб додати його до єдиного каталогу Києва.</p>
            </div>

            <form action="/shops" method="POST">
                
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="name" class="form-label fw-semibold small">Назва кав'ярні *</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Наприклад: Yellow Place" required>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="address" class="form-label fw-semibold small">Адреса *</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="address" name="address" placeholder="Наприклад: вул. Мечникова, 3" required>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="opening_hours" class="form-label fw-semibold small">Години роботи</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="opening_hours" name="opening_hours" placeholder="Наприклад: Пн-Нд: 08:00 - 21:00">
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="image_url" class="form-label fw-semibold small">Посилання на фото (URL)</label>
                    <input type="url" class="form-control" id="image_url" name="image_url" placeholder="https://example.com/image.jpg">
                </div>

                <div class="mb-4">
                    <label for="description" class="form-label fw-semibold small">Опис / Особливості закладу</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control" id="description" name="description" rows="4" placeholder="Розкажіть про атмосферу, кавомашину чи десерти..."></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-coffee flex-fill py-2">Зберегти кав'ярню</button>
                    <a href="/shops" class="btn btn-outline-secondary px-4 py-2 rounded-pill">Скасувати</a>
                </div>

            </form>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Bootstrap 5 JS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>